:"虎魄","title":"张飞_虎魄_移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"一往无前，侵略如火","hasText":true,"duration":2.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06075648BEEE71000183739353438353534.mp3"},{"id":"06456648BEEE71000183132353534303036","heroId":"242","skinId":"548","skinName":"虎魄","title":"张飞_虎魄_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"虎有利爪，触之则怒，怒，则流血三千里","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06456648BEEE71000183132353534303036.mp3"},{"id":"06746648BEEE71000183237393835363030","heroId":"242","skinId":"548","skinName":"虎魄","title":"张飞_虎魄_移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"所谓的弱，就是一种原罪","hasText":true,"duration":3.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06746648BEEE71000183237393835363030.mp3"},{"id":"06370648BEEE61000183139343036363634","heroId":"242","skinId":"548","skinName":"虎魄","title":"张飞_虎魄_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"（英灵：五虎之志）五虎之志未已，再战百世轮回！","hasText":true,"duration":13.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06370648BEEE61000183139343036363634.mp3"},{"id":"06218648BEA8B1000183132303833373136","heroId":"242","skinId":"887","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"张飞_百相守梦_技能语音2_01","category":"技能","seq":1,"text":"此地禁止胡来","hasText":true,"duration":2.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06218648BEA8B1000183132303833373136.mp3"},{"id":"06790648BEA8B1000183138393237373535","heroId":"242","skinId":"887","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"张飞_百相守梦_技能语音3_01","category":"技能","seq":1,"text":"于风暴中，啸惊雷","hasText":true,"duration":2.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06790648BEA8B1000183138393237373535.mp3"},{"id":"06300648BEA8A1000183133313232363038","heroId":"242","skinId":"887","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"张飞_百相守梦_技能语音1_01","category":"技能","seq":1,"text":"荡开梦魇","hasText":true,"duration":1.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/242/06300648BEA8A1000183133313232363038.mp3"},{"id":"06016648BEA8B1000183335363434313536","heroId":"242","skinId":"887",